  "term": "Narcissistic Personality Inventory",
  "definition": "The Narcissistic Personality Inventory is a self-report assessment commonly used to measure narcissism, particularly its grandiose expression. The source describes it as a multidimensional construct that has been modeled in different ways, while also supporting use of the overall total score as a measure of grandiose narcissistic personality features.",
